{"id":"H1813","lemma":"דַּלְפוֹן","transliteration":"dalphon","sayIt":"dal-PHON","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Dalphon","meaning":"A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Est.9.7;\nson of: Haman (H2001);\nbrother of: Parshandatha (H6577), Aspatha (H0630), Poratha (H6334), Adalia (H0118), Aridatha (H0743), Parmashta (H6534), Arisai (H0747), Aridai (H0742) and Vaizatha (H2055)\n§ Dalphon = \"dripping\"\nthe second of the 10 sons of Haman","glosses":["dalphon"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"est-9","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Dalphon","kjv":"and Dalphon"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Esther 9:7","note":"They killed Parshandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0118","lemma":"אֲדַלְיָא","transliteration":"adalya","gloss":"Adalia"},{"id":"H0630","lemma":"אַסְפָּ֑תָא","transliteration":"aspata","gloss":"Aspatha"},{"id":"H0742","lemma":"אֲרִידַי","transliteration":"ariday","gloss":"Aridai"},{"id":"H0743","lemma":"אֲרִידָ֑תָא","transliteration":"aridata","gloss":"Aridatha"},{"id":"H0747","lemma":"אֲרִיסַי","transliteration":"arisay","gloss":"Arisai"},{"id":"H2001","lemma":"הָמָן","transliteration":"haman","gloss":"Haman"},{"id":"H6577","lemma":"פַּרְשַׁנְדָּתָא","transliteration":"parshandata","gloss":"Parshandatha"},{"id":"H6334","lemma":"פּוֹרָתָא","transliteration":"porata","gloss":"Poratha"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}